meta {
  name: Majo API
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{operatorToken}}
}

docs {
  # Majo operator API

  Every `/api` route needs an operator token (`Authorization: Bearer ...`):
  a named token from `go run ./cmd/operatorctl create`, or the shared
  `OPERATOR_API_TOKEN`. VIEWER tokens can run the read folders only.

  The token is a **secret** variable: set it in Bruno's environment editor
  (it is stored outside these files) or pass `--env-var operatorToken=...`
  to `bru run`. Never write a token into a `.bru` file.

  Folders 01–04 and 06 only read. Folder 05 changes data (creates a vendor,
  pauses and resumes a request): run it against a local or test database only.
}
